                    "text": "At Winslow Gerolamy Motors Limited, we understand that for our customers in the trucking industry, time is money. For over 70 years as a full line International Truck Dealership, we have been committed to ensuring maximum uptime for your fleet.\n\nOur value proposition is centered on three key pillars: Unbeatable Selection, Unmatched Service, and Exceptional Value.",
